    "body": "## Purpose\r\n\r\nPooling routes were registered for every supported task even though handlers existed only for the selected task. Register dedicated routes only for the selected task so unavailable APIs return 404 instead of 5xx.\r\n\r\n## Reproducer\r\n\r\nStart BGE-M3 with token classification selected:\r\n\r\n```bash\r\nCUDA_VISIBLE_DEVICES=0 VLLM_USE_V2_MODEL_RUNNER=1 vllm serve BAAI/bge-m3 \\\r\n  --runner pooling \\\r\n  --max-model-len 512 \\\r\n  --hf-overrides '{\"architectures\": [\"BgeM3EmbeddingModel\"]}' \\\r\n  --pooler-config.task token_classify\r\n```\r\n\r\nThen call an unselected dedicated embedding route and the selected generic pooling route:\r\n\r\n```bash\r\ncurl -sS -X POST http://localhost:8000/v1/embeddings \\\r\n  -H 'Content-Type: application/json' \\\r\n  -d '{\"model\":\"BAAI/bge-m3\",\"input\":[\"What is BGE M3?\"],\"encoding_format\":\"float\"}'\r\n\r\ncurl -sS -X POST http://localhost:8000/pooling \\\r\n  -H 'Content-Type: application/json' \\\r\n  -d '{\"model\":\"BAAI/bge-m3\",\"input\":[\"What is BGE M3?\"],\"task\":\"token_classify\"}'\r\n```\r\n\r\n## Output on main vs on branch\r\n\r\n**Main:**\r\n\r\n```text\r\n{\"route\": \"/v1/embeddings\", \"status\": 501, \"body\": \"{\\\"error\\\":{\\\"message\\\":\\\"The model does not support Embeddings API\\\",\\\"type\\\":\\\"NotImplementedError\\\",\\\"param\\\":null,\\\"code\\\":501}}\"}\r\n{\"route\": \"/v2/embed\", \"status\": 501, \"body\": \"{\\\"error\\\":{\\\"message\\\":\\\"The model does not support Embeddings API\\\",\\\"type\\\":\\\"NotImplementedError\\\",\\\"param\\\":null,\\\"code\\\":501}}\"}\r\n{\"route\": \"/classify\", \"status\": 404, \"body\": \"{\\\"detail\\\":\\\"Not Found\\\"}\"}\r\n{\"route\": \"/pooling\", \"status\": 200, \"body\": \"{\\\"id\\\":\\\"pooling-b85d5e2420853eaf\\\",\\\"object\\\":\\\"list\\\",\\\"created\\\":1789805504,\\\"model\\\":\\\"BAAI/bge-m3\\\",...\"}\r\n```\r\n\r\n**This branch:**\r\n\r\n```text\r\n{\"route\": \"/v1/embeddings\", \"status\": 404, \"body\": \"{\\\"detail\\\":\\\"Not Found\\\"}\"}\r\n{\"route\": \"/v2/embed\", \"status\": 404, \"body\": \"{\\\"detail\\\":\\\"Not Found\\\"}\"}\r\n{\"route\": \"/classify\", \"status\": 404, \"body\": \"{\\\"detail\\\":\\\"Not Found\\\"}\"}\r\n{\"route\": \"/pooling\", \"status\": 200, \"body\": \"{\\\"id\\\":\\\"pooling-b28fd5246cb24ce5\\\",\\\"object\\\":\\\"list\\\",\\\"created\\\":1789805208,\\\"model\\\":\\\"BAAI/bge-m3\\\",...\"}\r\n```\r\n\r\nThe complete branch route matrix was:\r\n\r\n| Selected task | `/v1/embeddings` | `/v2/embed` | `/classify` | `/pooling` |\r\n|---|---:|---:|---:|---:|\r\n| `embed` | 200 | 200 | 404 | 200 |\r\n| `token_embed` | 404 | 404 | 404 | 200 |\r\n| `token_classify` | 404 | 404 | 404 | 200 |\r\n\r\nNo branch request returned HTTP 5xx, and the branch server logs contained no missing-handler or uninitialized-serving-state error.\r\n\r\n## Test Plan\r\n\r\n```bash\r\n.venv/bin/python -m pytest \\\r\n  tests/entrypoints/pooling/test_factories.py \\\r\n  -vv\r\n```\r\n\r\nResult: `3 passed, 20 warnings in 0.78s`.\r\n\r\n```bash\r\nVLLM_USE_V2_MODEL_RUNNER=1 .venv/bin/python -m pytest \\\r\n  tests/models/language/pooling/test_bge_m3.py \\\r\n  --collect-only -q\r\n```\r\n\r\nResult: `12 tests collected`; all four cases were collected for each selected task: `embed`, `token_embed`, and `token_classify`.\r\n\r\n```bash\r\nVLLM_USE_V2_MODEL_RUNNER=1 .venv/bin/python -m pytest \\\r\n  tests/models/language/pooling/test_bge_m3.py \\\r\n  -vv -s\r\n```\r\n\r\nResult: `12 passed, 14 warnings in 157.19s`. Dense similarity, sparse token-classification, and multi-vector/token-embedding checks all passed their existing 1% tolerances.\r\n\r\n```bash\r\n.venv/bin/pre-commit run --files \\\r\n  vllm/entrypoints/pooling/factories.py \\\r\n  tests/entrypoints/pooling/test_factories.py \\\r\n  tests/models/language/pooling/test_bge_m3.py\r\n```\r\n\r\nResult: all applicable hooks passed.\r\n\r\n## AI assistance disclosure\r\n\r\nGPT-5 Codex assisted with drafting the code and validation workflow.",
